    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classQfNearFieldReader" kindref="compound">QfNearFieldReader</ref> class allows for the scanning of near-field targets. When text strings are present on targets, the strings will be automatically read and a signal emitted with the string values. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
